&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;As international issues continue to increase in frequency&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;our methods of operation must also adapt&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Additional bears are being trained for intervention protocol&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;to alleviate future strain on resources&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Until further notice please continue operations as normal&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Thank you for your cooperation&lt;/p&gt;
