&lt;div class=&quot;warning&quot;&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span&gt;Director D.C. al Fine&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have &lt;span style=&quot;color: red&quot;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt; unread messages, all marked &amp;quot;PRIORITY&amp;quot;. Displaying message &lt;span style=&quot;color: red&quot;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt; of &lt;span style=&quot;color: red&quot;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&amp;#8230;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;blockquote&quot;&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;wiki-content-table&quot;&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;BREACH URGENT&lt;/td&gt;
